{"timestamp":"2026-11-03T19:23:25.240Z","ordinal":78429,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-df709e72-d403-45f2-9212-1b3eb74be1b2","process_id":"51168","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n 'install-evaluator-toolchains|preinstalled|/usr/local/go|package_runtime.test|remove.*SDK|sdk trees|nexus-qual' .github scripts eval docs/releases docs/v1.1.2 | head -150 && rg -n 'maskedSystemDirectoryPaths|systemDirectories' eval/isolate.mjs"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-rc2-package","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'install-evaluator-toolchains|preinstalled|/usr/local/go|package_runtime.test|remove.*SDK|sdk trees|nexus-qual' .github scripts eval docs/releases docs/v1.1.2","query":"install-evaluator-toolchains|preinstalled|/usr/local/go|package_runtime.test|remove.*SDK|sdk trees|nexus-qual","path":".github"},{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'maskedSystemDirectoryPaths|systemDirectories' eval/isolate.mjs","query":"maskedSystemDirectoryPaths|systemDirectories","path":"isolate.mjs"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md:13:- The evaluator's compiler-exposure check no longer depends on deleting the hosted runner's preinstalled SDK trees. It masks host-only SDK directories inside the candidate sandbox under every mounted spelling, ignores an inventoried path only when it has been removed before inspection, and names the cause when its inventory helper fails (timeout, kill, nonzero exit or unexpected output). Every other inspection error still refuses qualification. RC13's release run failed when this check refused in two evaluator tests.\ndocs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.12.md:20:- The evaluator binds the pinned Go and Rust toolchains read-only and masks unpinned compilers that are visible to candidates. CI removes the hosted runner's preinstalled SDK trees before evaluator tests, so the fail-closed compiler inventory stays inside its fixed 25 s deadline.\ndocs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.13.md:13:- The release job now prepares the same evaluator environment as CI before it runs the test suite: the pinned Go toolchain, the pinned evaluator toolchains, and removal of the hosted runner's preinstalled SDK trees. RC12's release run failed without them (`go: command not found`, and `compiler exposure could not be checked; refusing qualification`). A test now fails if the release and CI workflows disagree on this setup.\n.github/workflows/release.yml:31:        run: bash scripts/install-evaluator-toolchains.sh\ndocs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md:29:| WP-1104 — Standalone `nexus eval` | Packaged command supports dataset selection, run count, isolated home, and structured score output. | Integrated in commit `11f41ed0`. Verified package parity and standalone CLI execution outside repository checkout. | **PASSED** | Validated in `eval/package_runtime.test.mjs` (5/5 passed). Verified with isolated HOME, dataset selection, and structured scoring. |\n.github/workflows/ci.yml:26:        run: bash scripts/install-evaluator-toolchains.sh\n.github/workflows/ci.yml:124:        run: bash scripts/install-evaluator-toolchains.sh\neval/host/README.md:16:| Size-capped tmpfs | `srv-nexus\\x2dqual-ws.mount` at `/srv/nexus-qual/ws`, `size=storageBytes,mode=0711,uid=<operator>,nosuid,nodev` | The resource contract's `workspaceRoot`: the hard cap on what a run keeps, across all phases. |\neval/host/README.md:17:| Runtime directory | `/opt/nexus-qual` (root, 0755) | `sandboxRuntimeRoots` for the installed RC and the peer agents. It is filled per RC. |\neval/host/README.md:21:- `rollback.sh` removes them. It keeps `/opt/nexus-qual` unless you pass `--purge-runtime`, and it leaves `acl` installed.\nscripts/install-evaluator-toolchains.sh:66:sudo rm -rf -- /usr/local/go /usr/local/nexus-qual/rust\nscripts/install-evaluator-toolchains.sh:67:sudo install -d -o root -g root -m 0755 /usr/local /usr/local/go /usr/local/nexus-qual /usr/local/nexus-qual/rust\nscripts/install-evaluator-toolchains.sh:70:sudo cp -aL -- \"$go_root/.\" /usr/local/go/\nscripts/install-evaluator-toolchains.sh:71:sudo cp -aL -- \"$rust_root/.\" /usr/local/nexus-qual/rust/\nscripts/install-evaluator-toolchains.sh:72:sudo chown -hR root:root /usr/local/go /usr/local/nexus-qual/rust\nscripts/install-evaluator-toolchains.sh:73:sudo chmod -R go-w /usr/local/go /usr/local/nexus-qual/rust\nscripts/install-evaluator-toolchains.sh:75:copied_go=\"$(/usr/local/go/bin/go version | awk '{print $3}')\"\nscripts/install-evaluator-toolchains.sh:76:copied_rustc=\"$(/usr/local/nexus-qual/rust/bin/rustc --version | awk '{print $2}')\"\nscripts/install-evaluator-toolchains.sh:77:copied_cargo=\"$(/usr/local/nexus-qual/rust/bin/cargo --version | awk '{print $2}')\"\neval/isolate.mjs:36:  { root: \"/usr/local/go\", sourceRoots: [\"/usr/local/go\", \"/opt/nexus-qual/go\"], required: [\"bin/go\"] },\neval/isolate.mjs:37:  { root: \"/usr/local/nexus-qual/rust\", sourceRoots: [\"/usr/local/nexus-qual/rust\", \"/opt/nexus-qual/rust\"], required: [\"bin/rustc\", \"bin/cargo\"] },\neval/isolate.mjs:50:    ...(toolchains.rustRoot ? [\"/usr/local/nexus-qual/rust/bin\"] : []),\neval/isolate.mjs:51:    ...(toolchains.goRoot ? [\"/usr/local/go/bin\"] : []),\neval/isolate.mjs:71:  if (root === \"/usr/local/go\") {\neval/isolate.mjs:77:  if (root === \"/usr/local/nexus-qual/rust\") {\neval/isolate.mjs:104:    args.push(\"--ro-bind\", toolchains.goRoot, \"/usr/local/go\");\neval/isolate.mjs:108:    ensureDirectory(\"/usr/local/nexus-qual\");\neval/isolate.mjs:109:    args.push(\"--ro-bind\", toolchains.rustRoot, \"/usr/local/nexus-qual/rust\");\neval/isolate.mjs:138:      const versions = root === \"/usr/local/go\"\neval/isolate.mjs:140:        : root === \"/usr/local/nexus-qual/rust\"\neval/isolate.mjs:156:    goRoot: roots[\"/usr/local/go\"],\neval/isolate.mjs:157:    rus