{"timestamp":"2026-11-03T19:41:43.010Z","ordinal":78961,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1a2ee-84e1-7a93-a085-4e81a0f79cc6","call_id":"call_c4ef6be5c7d44f0e8d048cc232d1c35a","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[\"mcp__codex_apps__gmail_bulk_label_matching_emails — Apply a label to every Gmail message matching a Gmail search query. This action performs the search and label batching server-side, so it is suitable for very large backf\",\"mcp__codex_apps__gmail_send_email — Send a Gmail message now from the authenticated account. Supply message headers and a MIME tree. Set `to` to `me` to send to the authenticated Gmail account. Use `create_\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__acknowledge_message — Acknowledge a message addressed to an agent (and mark as read).\\n\\nBehavior\\n--------\\n- Sets both read_ts and ack_ts for the (agent, message) pairing\\n- Safe to call multiple\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__archive_project — Soft-delete a project: mark it as archived so it is hidden from active project lists. All messages are preserved and the project can be restored with unarchive_project.\\n\\n\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__create_agent_identity — Create a new, unique agent identity and persist its profile to Git.\\n\\nHow this differs from `register_agent`\\n--------------------------------------\\n- Always creates a new \",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent — Remove an agent from a project. Marks the agent as inactive and removes it from the active roster. Messages from/to the agent are preserved for audit but the agent can no\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__ensure_project — Idempotently create or ensure a project exists for the given human key.\\n\\nWhen to use\\n-----------\\n- First call in a workflow targeting a new repo/path identifier.\\n- As a g\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__expire_window — Mark a window identity as expired.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nwindow_uuid : str\\n    The UUID of the window identity to expire.\\n\\nRetu\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_inbox — Retrieve recent messages for an agent without mutating read/ack state.\\n\\nFilters\\n-------\\n- `urgent_only`: only messages with importance in {high, urgent}\\n- `since_ts`: ISO\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_summary — Retrieve stored project-wide summaries.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nsince_hours : float\\n    Return summaries whose end_ts is within t\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_topic — Fetch all messages in a project with a given topic tag, regardless of recipient.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\ntopic_name : str\\n    The\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__file_reservation_paths — Request advisory file reservations (leases) on project-relative paths/globs.\\n\\nSemantics\\n---------\\n- Conflicts are reported if an overlapping active exclusive reservation \",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__force_release_file_reservation — Force-release a stale file reservation held by another agent after inactivity heuristics.\\n\\nThe tool validates that the reservation appears abandoned (agent inactive beyon\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__hard_delete_agent — IRREVERSIBLY delete an agent and ALL associated data: messages sent by the agent, message recipient records, file reservations, agent links, window identities, and on-dis\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__hard_delete_project — IRREVERSIBLY delete a project and ALL associated data: every agent, message, message recipient, file reservation, agent link, window identity, message summary, sibling su\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__health_check — Return basic readiness information for the Agent Mail server.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project \",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__install_precommit_guard — Install the Agent Mail pre-commit guard into a git repository.\\n\\nThe guard blocks a commit that stages files another agent holds an\\nexclusive file reservation on (set ``AG\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts — List contact links for an agent in a project.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to coope\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities — List active window identities for a project.\\n\\nReturns all non-expired window identities with their display names,\\nlast activity timestamps, and age.\\n\\nParameters\\n---------\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_contact_handshake — Request contact permissions and optionally auto-approve plus send a welcome message.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordinatio\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_file_reservation_cycle — Reserve a set of file paths and optionally release them at the end of the workflow.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_prepare_thread — Macro helper that aligns an agent with an existing thread by ensuring registration,\\nsummarising the thread, and fetching recent inbox context.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_start_session — Macro helper that boots a project session: ensure project, register agent,\\noptionally file_reservation paths, and fetch the latest inbox snapshot.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent \",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__mark_message_read — Mark a specific message as read for the given agent.\\n\\nNotes\\n-----\\n- Read receipts are per-recipient; this only affects the specified agent.\\n- This does not send an acknow\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__purge_old_messages — Delete messages older than the configured retention period. Defaults to retention_max_age_days from config (180 days). Returns count of messages purged.\\n\\nYou are the MCP \",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__register_agent — Create or update an agent identity within a project and persist its profile to Git.\\n\\nWhen to use\\n-----------\\n- At the start of a coding session by any automated agent.\\n- \",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__release_file_reservations — Release active file reservations held by an agent.\\n\\nBehavior\\n--------\\n- If both `paths` and `file_reservation_ids` are omitted, all active reservations for the agent are \",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__rename_window — Update the display name of a window identity.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nwindow_uuid : str\\n    The UUID of the window identity to re\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__renew_file_reservations — Extend expiry for active file reservations held by an agent without reissuing them.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project slug or human key.\\nagent_name : s\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__reply_message — Reply to an existing message, preserving or establishing a thread.\\n\\nBehavior\\n--------\\n- Inherits original `importance` and `ack_required` flags\\n- `thread_id` is taken fro\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__request_contact — Request contact approval to message another agent.\\n\\nCreates (or refreshes) a pending AgentLink and sends a small ack_required intro message.\\n\\nDiscovery\\n---------\\nTo disco\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__respond_contact — Approve or deny a contact request.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agen\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__retire_agent — Soft-delete an agent: mark it as retired so it stops accepting new messages while preserving message history. Retired agents are hidden from active agent lists but visibl\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__search_messages — Full-text search over subject and body for a project.\\n\\nTips\\n----\\n- SQLite FTS5 syntax supported: phrases (\\\"build plan\\\"), prefix (mig*), boolean (plan AND users)\\n- Results\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__send_message — Send a Markdown message to one or more recipients and persist canonical and mailbox copies to Git.\\n\\nDiscovery\\n---------\\nTo discover available agent names for recipients, \",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__set_contact_policy — Set contact policy for an agent: open | auto | contacts_only | block_all.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, \",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__summarize_recent — Summarize all recent project messages within a time window.\\n\\nFetches messages from the last ``since_hours`` hours, groups them by\\nthread, and produces a combined project-\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__summarize_thread — Extract participants, key points, and action items for one or more threads.\\n\\nSingle-thread mode (thread_id is a single ID):\\n- Returns detailed summary with optional examp\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__sweep_stale_agents — Retire abandoned agents in the caller's project using the server's conservative inactivity heuristic. The caller is never retired, the threshold has a 60-second floor, an\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unarchive_project — Restore an archived project back to active status.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to \",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__uninstall_precommit_guard — Remove the Agent Mail commit guards from a git repository.\\n\\nRemoves Agent Mail's own pre-commit and pre-push guard plugins (and a\\nlegacy single-file Agent Mail hook); oth\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unretire_agent — Restore a retired agent back to active status. The agent will resume accepting new messages.\\n\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coo\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__whois — Return enriched profile details for an agent, optionally including recent archive commits.\\n\\nDiscovery\\n---------\\nTo discover available agent names, use: resource://agents/\"]"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793734903.0096924}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
