{"timestamp":"2026-11-03T19:42:50.035Z","ordinal":79036,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0fd4138577b17921016aea3935b54481a3a15a1f857b825360","status":"completed","call_id":"call_379d04ae4ff84eaf96ddb5a0f89518bb","name":"exec","input":"const patch=\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1101-integration/docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\\n@@\\n-## Current v1.1.2 roadmap alignment\\n+## Separate specialist roadmap status (informational)\\n \\n-The candidate branch `v1/v112-wp1101-integration` contains the WP-1101–WP-1108 release scope. The current [Specialist Orchestration and Independent Review roadmap](../v1.1.2/ROADMAP.md) separately records items that were cut or remain unconnected; they are not qualified by the WP evidence below:\\n+The approved v1.1.2 release scope is the full WP-1101–WP-1108 roadmap from v1.1.0, as recorded in [the release scope](v1.1.2.md). The [Specialist Orchestration and Independent Review roadmap](../v1.1.2/ROADMAP.md) is tracked separately; its status below is informational and does not add work or gates to this release scope.\\n@@\\n-| Item 1 — Specialist contracts | Runtime roles, contracts, and tool permissions connected; PR #396 review fixes present. | **PASSED.** Verified via specialist profile and runtime tests. |\\n-| Item 2 — Independent review boundary | Reviewer evidence packaging and verdict gating connected. | **PASSED.** Verified via boundary, verifier, and operation tests. |\\n-| Item 3 — Deterministic micro-routing | The roadmap records this item as cut. | **CUT; not a release qualification claim.** |\\n-| Item 4 — Multi-stage escalation | The roadmap records this item as cut; recovery behavior is supplied by PR #398. | **CUT; not a release qualification claim.** |\\n-| Item 5 — Telemetry-informed throttle | The roadmap says this is not yet connected to request latency. | **NOT CONNECTED; not qualified.** |\\n-| Item 6 — Comparative evaluation harness | The roadmap says the comparative harness entry point is not yet connected. | **NOT CONNECTED; not qualified.** |\\n-| Item 7 — CERI | The roadmap says the `nexus eval` entry point is not yet connected. | **NOT CONNECTED; not qualified.** |\\n+| Item 1 — Specialist contracts | Runtime roles, contracts, and tool permissions connected; PR #396 review fixes present. | Connected on the separate roadmap; not a WP-1101–WP-1108 qualification claim. |\\n+| Item 2 — Independent review boundary | Reviewer evidence packaging and verdict gating connected. | Connected on the separate roadmap; not a WP-1101–WP-1108 qualification claim. |\\n+| Item 3 — Deterministic micro-routing | The roadmap records this item as cut. | Cut on the separate roadmap; outside this release scope. |\\n+| Item 4 — Multi-stage escalation | The roadmap records this item as cut; recovery behavior is supplied by PR #398. | Cut on the separate roadmap; outside this release scope. |\\n+| Item 5 — Telemetry-informed throttle | The roadmap says this is not yet connected to request latency. | Not connected on the separate roadmap; outside this release scope. |\\n+| Item 6 — Comparative evaluation harness | The roadmap says the comparative harness entry point is not yet connected. | Not connected on the separate roadmap; outside this release scope. |\\n+| Item 7 — CERI | The roadmap says the `nexus eval` entry point is not yet connected. | Not connected on the separate roadmap; outside this release scope. |\\n@@\\n-- [ ] Current v1.1.2 roadmap items and release gates are qualified on the final candidate.\\n+- [ ] Applicable v1.1.0 release gates G1.1-1 through G1.1-5 are qualified on the final candidate.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793734965.709792}}}
