{"timestamp":"2026-11-03T19:51:23.779Z","ordinal":79478,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1a2f7-6183-79d1-a915-a5179654f92b","author":"/root/review_delta","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/review_delta\nPayload:\n**APPROVED_WITH_CHANGES.** The implementation chunks, request-shape tests, and primary references are well scoped, and the plan correctly keeps the separate roadmap deferral superseded.\n\nBefore RED, define AC5’s per-provider sample size and denominator, how calls cover tool schemas, and the exact native-valid, repaired, and invalid classifications and pass calculation. Specify endpoint/server and model identity/config, plus how each provider is positively identified. Name and claim the matrix runner or command and tests that produce and validate evidence containing archive SHA, provider details, and per-endpoint counts. Keep mock serialization tests distinct from the required live endpoint matrix."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793735483.7794216,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":2767}}
