{"timestamp":"2026-11-03T19:53:13.542Z","ordinal":79561,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016aea3ba8bec881a3a5988d1914334cae","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The revised plan now fixes the matrix at 200 attempts per provider, evenly split across four tools, with an integer pass threshold and explicit failure classification. It also separates request-shape tests from live endpoint evidence. I’m adding one final detail to make the evidence self-verifying, then I’ll wait for the reviewer’s plan verdict before moving to references or tests."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793735592796,"completed_at_ms":1793735593541}}
