{"timestamp":"2026-11-03T20:07:15.829Z","ordinal":80410,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-94037bb0-f9f5-4811-a429-815535b5a279","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"list":"v1.1.2-release","includeClosed":true},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- v1.1.2-release: state=WP-1103/1104 full qualification completed at 789b247a; WP-1105 code evaluators integrated into runner and scorer at e2bacf1a. Ready for WP-1106 single-step loop mode., phase=scope reconciliation and owner coordination, gate=WP-1101 source candidate 97945557 full CLI suite PASS 2314/0/5; RC.2 version-only test PASS 1/1; npm build PASS; current make test on f6d474a4 started with 43 Rust core tests and CLI suite active; Rust core unit group 43 PASS, TUI group 254 in progress., next=Make qualification record explicitly separate the user's approved WP-1101–WP-1108 release scope from the current specialist roadmap; then resume dependent G1.1-4 only after GATEWAY holder clears or coordinates., friction=No current assertion failures. Existing remote GATEWAY claim remains held by a separate RC15 agent on ubuntu-desktop; avoid inference-backed benchmark until cleared., updated=2026-11-03T00:33:00Z, reviewer=/root/review_delta fresh independent review requested and running., REDACTED; final narrow update confirmation pending, retrieval=XERJ nexus-cli client.ts:1317 chatCompletion signature; agent.ts:5819 recovery submit boundary; exact local call sites reviewed; XERJ follow-up field report submitted., active_agents=Read-only audit delegated to /root/v112_unblocked_work to identify safe progress that does not load the shared test host., heartbeat=2026-11-03 13:14:51 UTC, claim=WP1101_TRACING plus cli/src/agent.ts, cli/test/agent_observer.test.ts, docs/v1.1.0/WP-1101-PLAN.md and SUITE held., candidateTree=1518780db3fbc3f2bc06312aa7bea137a67ce26d clean integrated branch; 1ecdd557 detached qualification snapshot, suite=/tmp/wp1101-full-suite-rerun.log; snapshot /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1101-qualification; run started after copy of current WP-1101 files and local node_modules replacement., build=npm run build PASS, cargo release builds PASS, artifactAcceptance=PASS: pinned Bookworm package archive 27dbbb8120e755061e92218eaceb5e12b7d9457230b9b0aa82b96d28cc3791ee; six benchmark tasks PASS, packageRevision=1ecdd557ebe31267c67f281b49d64605e5464777, wp1102Fix=cli/src/sidecar.ts preserves typed workspace path in session.state, applies legacy credential key/value fallback after canonical sanitizer, and emits concise sanitized startup errors; 68/68 focused tests pass., suiteLog=/tmp/v112-wp1105-exact-full-suite.log, roadmapNext=/root/roadmap_next read-only audit identifies WP-1101 tracing as next unblocked item after WP-1105; prototype branch 8a83c9e7 exists but unclaimed, inspect read-only and create new slice after finishing current suite., wp1105=DONE commits e526ba90 (WP-1102 sidecar regression) and 5828e83c (WP-1105 evaluator integration); independent review approved; full exact candidate suite green, log SHA-256 a6cb0af8fc67e710934abce01d0001366e5ac68455b4a894c86b396bf243f4a4., wp1101Spec=Second reviewer pass found one omitted ExecutionState: LIMIT_REACHED. Added OTel unset mapping and limit-reached test case to AC1; requested final confirmation from /root/review_delta. No implementation code written., wp1101Red=/tmp/wp1101-red-agent-observer.log SHA-256 cc7dd19608f3b61e746473d3944f1eca34b46d1f746fcb8e2ad9adc6ebc2f7ab; four trace expectations failed as assertions; fail-safe AC already satisfied by baseline and now guarded against recorder path failure., wp1101Focused=/tmp/wp1101-focused-green.log current SHA to capture after final run; last focused run 11/11 pass., evidence=/tmp/wp1101-final-qualified-suite-evidence.txt SHA-256 e795474bab9a71c0ecd0bdedffef8db5ceeaff81935ab3f7edbb964c7d741e17, rc2Version=1.1.2-rc.2 synchronized across root, CLI, Cargo manifest and lockfiles; package version unit test PASS, candidateHead=f6d474a4, activeClaim=SUITE held for exact RC.2 make test on isolated worktree; eval workspace is dedicated 128 MB tmpfs, review=/root/review_delta APPROVED final archive evidence and qualification status. Review confirms evidence hash, archive digest, six benchmark invocations, no missing/skipped tasks, hiddenPass=false as fixture expectation, G1.1-2 boundary-only, G1.1-3 package runtime, G1.1-4 and external CI/CodeQL/publication pending., updated 25 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Resume WP-1104 full suite and roadmap release (state=Latest exact WP-1103 AC2 full-suite qualification remains pending. Historical suite on snapshot 00a8cb4d is red 2133 pass/3 fail/2 skipped (log SHA e6ea08b2), had no process-scope postcheck, and overlapped PR396 full-suite test traffic; independent review says failures are outside WP-1103 files, but cancellation/TUI need quiet rerun and upgrade test needs reachable fixture/network. Other owner's PR396 suite PID 2050438/2050464 is verified live through 12:14 UTC in /home/mike/nexus-wt/pr396-takeover; no new tests started. Added shared conflict record. Reconciled the user-approved full-roadmap scope in dedicated branch v1/v112-scope-reconciliation commit 4b63cee0, exact-doc assertions and diff check pass, independent reviewer approved; scope file claim released. The source roadmap remains under Antigravity's DOCS_POST_V1_ROADMAP claim. No release yet., work_product=/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration, details=Continue full v1.1.2 scope. WP-1104 standalone eval source slice remains reviewed/closed at 05c49df2 and 2a94f62e. WP-1103 AC2 is implemented but uncommitted pending exact-source clean suite; current host has unclaimed PR396 suite traffic, so do not run tests. Release scope documentation is corrected in 4b63cee0 on v1/v1