HEAD:vllm/entrypoints/launchers/app.py:27:            \"build_app and will be required in a future version. \"\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/launchers/grpc_server.py:40:        \"version mismatch — see the chained exception above for details.\"\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/launchers/grpc_server.py:47:from vllm.entrypoints.common.startup import log_version_and_model\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/launchers/grpc_server.py:52:from vllm.version import __version__ as VLLM_VERSION\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/launchers/grpc_server.py:168:    log_version_and_model(logger, VLLM_VERSION, args.model)\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/launchers/launcher.py:23:    log_version_and_model,\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/launchers/launcher.py:30:from vllm.version import __version__ as VLLM_VERSION\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/launchers/launcher.py:368:    log_version_and_model(logger, VLLM_VERSION, args.model)\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/launchers/run_batch.py:78:from vllm.version import __version__ as VLLM_VERSION\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/launchers/run_batch.py:683:    \"\"\"Unversioned endpoints (/score, /rerank) match by suffix; others exactly.\"\"\"\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/launchers/run_batch.py:1141:    logger.info(\"vLLM batch processing API version %s\", VLLM_VERSION)\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/llm.py:101:        revision: The specific model version to use. It can be a branch name,\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/llm.py:103:        tokenizer_revision: The specific tokenizer version to use. It can be a\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/mcp/tool.py:26:    \"\"\"Check if the gpt-oss is installed and its version is at least 0.0.7.\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/mcp/tool.py:29:    from importlib.metadata import PackageNotFoundError, version\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/mcp/tool.py:31:    from packaging.version import InvalidVersion, Version\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/mcp/tool.py:34:        pkg_version_str = version(\"gpt_oss\")\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/mcp/tool.py:35:        pkg_version = Version(pkg_version_str)\nHEAD:vllm/entrypoints/mcp/tool.py:39:        raise ImportError(f\"In