cratchpad>/snap (non-git export of db1ca55)\\n    npm ci --prefix demo && npm ci --prefix experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice\\n    REDACTED NEXUS_CF_NAMESPACE=nexus-contest-ci NEXUS_CF_REPOSITORY=fixture \\\\\\n      npm run typecheck --prefix experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice   # -> rc 0\\n    ... npm run build --prefix \\n    … (--full 1200 to see more)\\n\\n─── v1.0.0/READINESS.md:113  (score 1001.00)\\n    [#293](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/293) added operator guidance for `DecisionRejected` and is merged with its Node 22/24, Linux, and CodeQL checks successful. These source changes are implemented on current `main`.\\n    \\n    **Lifecycle, scheduler, and evaluation evidence:** `cli/test/convergence_integration.test.ts` covers end-to-end scheduling and execution scenarios. `cli/test/convergence_scheduler_properties.test.ts` runs generated DAG invariants over 100 fixed seeds; this is reproducible generated coverage, not a claim that every scheduler property or arbitrary graph has been \\n    … (--full 1200 to see more)\\n\\n─── v1.0.0/READINESS.md:610  (score 1001.00)\\n    - **Requirements enforcement:** `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` ran in a detached worktree at exact `6a16cb60635c9182f13be1635d5f44eddebdcde0` with isolated `HOME` and failed as required. It reports 123 rows (109 tested, 5 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open) and 11 below threshold: `REQ-AGT-002`, `REQ-AGT-010`, `REQ-PRV-003`, `REQ-REL-005`, `REQ-AGT-110`, `REQ-PRV-111`, `REQ-REL-114`, `REQ-QUAL-101`, `REQ-QUAL-107`, `REQ-QUAL-108`, and `REQ-QUAL-109`. The exact result is recorded in the claims log and was sent to the ledger owner in PR #17 comment `6252582027`; no ledger status cha\\n    … (--full 1200 to see more)\\n\\n─── reviews/NEXUS_TOP_TIER_QUALIFICATION_ASSESSMENT_2026-10-12.md:73  (score 1001.00)\\n     open panels so keys meant\\n       for them decide (F3) — on the installed build and on main.\\n    6. **No evidence base for qualification**: no task-level evaluation (E1), no CI (D2), no build identity (D1).\\n    \\n    Passing suites (Rust 237, CLI 728 at 804c5df), VERIFIED outcomes and self-assessed acceptance do not change this\\n    verdict: the defects above all sit in paths those suites do not exercise.\\n    \\n    ---\\n    \\n    ## 2. Scope and identity (verified 2026-10-12)\\n    \\n    | Item | Value |\\n    |---|---|\\n    | Repository | `/home/mike/nexus-code`, no git remote; ~90 worktrees from earlier campaigns (`git worktree list`) |\\n    | AGENTS.md | bu\\n    … (--full 1200 to see more)\\n\\n─── reviews/evidence/v1/GOV_DEC_AMENDMENTS/post-integration-2026-10-18.md:32  (score 1001.00)\\n    unchanged.\\n    - Continuity M1/M3/L5/N1–N3: PR-10g's commits do not address them; boundary requests + PR #10 coordination comment stand; owner has not yet responded.\\n    \\n    ## Held-out corpus (store v2) — status\\n    \\n    - **31 authored** (batches 1–7), **30 custodian-validated** via `bin/validate.py` in bounded SUITE windows (v7: 25/26 in 12 min; v8: 5/5), all 31 manifest hash pairs re-derived exactly; schema OK × 31.\\n    - **1 defect:** `ho2-go-debug-02` — post-patch hidden test and regression both fail under the custodian flow (author dry-run claimed green). Returned to the author for repair; not sealing-eligibl\\n    … (--full 1200 to see more)\\n\\n5 passage(s) from 'nexus-docs-*'. Cite ax_path:line (ax_path#locator for a data row) for anything you rely on.\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"d023bb\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.868619398,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":138,\"output\":\" M cli/src/client.ts\\n M cli/src/core/provider_capabilities.ts\\n M cli/test/provider_capabilities.test.ts\\n M docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\\n?? cli/src/core/tool_grammar_provider.ts\\n?? cli/test/client_tool_grammar.test.ts\\n?? docs/v1.1.0/WP-1107-PLAN.md\\n cli/src/client.ts                      | 28 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++--\\n cli/src/core/provider_capabilities.ts  | 14 ++++++++++----\\n cli/test/provider_capabilities.test.ts |  6 ++++++\\n docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md  | 11 ++++++-----\\n 4 files changed, 48 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793737841.7460976}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
