{"timestamp":"2026-11-03T20:59:08.393Z","ordinal":82407,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1a335-66e8-7891-bacf-6d721760e5df","author":"/root/release_gate_audit","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/release_gate_audit\nPayload:\nThe safest integration base is the clean release worktree at `f4f89734` on `v1/v112-release`. The WP-1107 provider work is still uncommitted in `/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1101-integration` at `3eea888a`; preserve and review that diff before integrating it.\n\nThe `cli/scripts/run_tests.mjs` claim is still formally held by codex-root under its old WP-1103/1104 scope. Its heartbeat is stale and no test runner is active, but no release or broken-claim entry exists. The proposed CLI test belongs under `cli/test/*.test.ts`, which the runner already discovers. The standalone eval matrix test is outside that discovery path, so run it as a separately claimed gate or reconcile the runner claim before adding it to the suite.\n\nThe WP-1107 file claims also remain on the provider worktree despite the later request to defer the work. The user’s instruction to include WP-1107 in v1.1.2 supersedes that deferral; reconcile those claims and the target branch before integration. GATEWAY remains held for RC15 E5, so the real endpoint matrix still needs an explicit handoff before inference."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1a331-c45a-70a3-a6bd-1ee2b1ee1a25","create_time":1793739548.392704,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":2826}}
