{"timestamp":"2026-11-03T21:32:44.366Z","ordinal":83376,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a1a331-c45a-70a3-a6bd-1ee2b1ee1a25","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016aea52f9f2bc81a38445bdb15bb765f5","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The reviewer found one last AC4 mismatch: the client caches a vLLM identity before advertisement discovery finishes, so a server with no usable capability catalog can receive strict adaptation even though discovery returns `unsupported`. The approved plan requires unsupported endpoints to keep the existing request shape. I’m adding a regression for that case and will clear the cache when discovery is unsupported."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793741562008,"completed_at_ms":1793741564366}}
