{"timestamp":"2026-11-03T23:11:16.329Z","ordinal":85780,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1a3ae-5f69-7162-9e7c-b35ebdf44999","author":"/root/review_delta","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/review_delta\nPayload:\n**APPROVED** for the proposed fixture, cache, and snapshot corrections.\n\nThe suite log separates into:\n\n- **Provider fixture updates:** the Ollama fixtures lack `/api/version`; the vLLM and token-count fixtures lack `/version`. Add the documented handshakes and assert detected provider kinds; keep the unsupported/no-adaptation and bare-catalog/no-probe regressions.\n- **Source regression:** `discoverAdvertisement` deletes the endpoint/model context cache on every call at [client.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1107-qualification/cli/src/client.ts:1137), causing the existing repeat-discovery test to make `/props` twice. Preserve valid cached context or invalidate it selectively.\n- **Qualification setup failures:** the candidate runtime resolves `@esbuild` into the integration worktree, outside the qualification snapshot’s allowlist; the run also lacks `NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_WORKSPACE_ROOT` and the built `nexus-tui` binary. Provision in-tree dependencies, the CI workspace fixture, and run `make build` in that snapshot. The compiler-exposure failures are fail-closed; this log does not establish their underlying cause, so verify the pinned compiler/toolchain environment during setup.\n- **Proxy fixture detail:** [model_proxy.mjs](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1107-qualification/eval/model_proxy.mjs:86) must allow and answer `/version` and `/api/version`; otherwise the updated vLLM/Ollama fixtures cannot complete their handshakes.\n\nI reviewed the log and source read-only; I did not run tests."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1a331-c45a-70a3-a6bd-1ee2b1ee1a25","create_time":1793747476.3296695,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":2919}}
