{"timestamp":"2026-11-03T23:11:35.280Z","ordinal":85785,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0fd4138577b17921016aea6a1f4bf481a38e5da0cac44e6123","status":"completed","call_id":"call_44c1234c5b15485a8126b119b2e7719f","name":"exec","input":"const patch=\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1101-integration/docs/v1.1.0/WP-1107-PLAN.md\\n@@\\n **Chunk 3 — Candidate endpoint matrix**\\n@@\\n - The all-supported-endpoint gate is falsifiable: any endpoint below the exact 99.5% native-valid threshold, any schema-invalid or invalid attempt, any missing identity, or any missing hybrid reasoning signal blocks WP-1107 completion.\\n+\\n+**Chunk 4 — Positive-identity qualification fixtures and discovery cache**\\n+\\n+- Keep the provider identity handshakes covered in deterministic discovery tests and make the standalone proxy emulate the same documented endpoints: vLLM `GET /version`, Ollama `GET /api/version` and selected-model `POST /api/show`. Assert the client's detected server kind for all three emulated profiles. A generic catalog without a positive handshake remains unknown and receives no provider-specific request adaptation.\\n+- Preserve the existing endpoint/model context cache across repeated discovery calls; the existing regression test requires one `/props` read for repeated llama.cpp discovery. Failed or unsupported handshakes remain uncached so a later discovery can retry.\\n+- Files: `cli/src/client.ts`, `cli/test/server_context_discovery.test.ts`, `cli/test/standalone_profiles.test.ts`, `cli/test/tokens.test.ts`, and `eval/model_proxy.mjs`.\\n+- Tests: `subsequent context discovery reuses cached advertisement without hitting probe endpoint again`; the three standalone profile tests assert positive detected kinds; `REQ-AGT-118: /tokenize works on llama.cpp (root /tokenize { tokens }) and vLLM (root /tokenize { count })` uses the documented vLLM identity response.\\n+- Qualification setup: build the exact candidate snapshot before `make test`; keep dependency resolution inside that snapshot; set the CI-equivalent evaluator workspace and runtime roots and pinned compiler/toolchain environment. The full gate must reach its terminal and security stages.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1a331-c45a-70a3-a6bd-1ee2b1ee1a25","create_time":1793747487.2980974}}}
