iew fixes (phase=corrected candidate source gates complete; independent re-review pending, gate=CERI runner now uses getBuildIdentity().version. Regression test RED against hardcoded RC1 then focused 3/3 PASS, green log SHA-256 61e0eab4c25d6071a8fb4b22f541a3248759bc0997c0b1124183ead05531a0b4; RED log SHA-256 31c308c12779d1ba6f2ce2c05421f4f0609261a4adc3ecd893d464dbc3893fea. Corrected full make test PASS: 2319 tests, 2314 pass, 0 fail, 5 skipped; 2,772,870 ms; SHA-256 39cad26938be30dbb4b073a4d93e62a80aa920789e751cccba5465795eb362bd. Security gate PASS on full updated diff; SHA-256 a9ebd74bcb62e98376fa5a1779172f815a0a80ec23af0b26b3c72e8732391180. make build / TypeScript build PASS. Terminal scope fixtures passed in npm test., next=Request peer re-review of complete package/version/CERI/test/qualification diff, then commit on approval and produce reproducible RC2 archive plus installed candidate evidence., friction=No source gate friction. Artifact, installed-RC, exact CI, independent acceptance, and owner publication remain open.), updated about 5 hours ago\\n  - [done] RC2 source qualification and reviewed candidate (phase=commit e134dcd5 complete; exact artifact qualification next, gate=Commit e134dcd5103446f97e341059b54d85883e4c52fd on top of f6d474a4. Independent review_delta APPROVED after corrections. CERI version fix backed by RED/GREEN logs (RED 31c308c1..., GREEN 61e0eab4...). Full corrected make test 2314/0/5 SHA-256 39cad26938be30dbb4b073a4d93e62a80aa920789e751cccba5465795eb362bd; security gates PASS SHA-256 a9ebd74bcb62e98376fa5a1779172f815a0a80ec23af0b26b3c72e8732391180; make build/type and terminal-scope fixture PASS. Worktree clean after commit; file claims released., next=Build exact e134dcd5 RC2 archive in the digest-pinned Docker builder, run reproducibility verification, verify checksum/SBOM/installer, then qualify installation and CLI parity on the artifact., friction=No source gate friction. Exact-commit artifact, installed-RC, external CI and independent acceptance remain unqualified. Owner retains tag/publish boundary.), updated about 5 hours ago\\n  - [done] RC2 exact commit source gates (phase=clean exact e134dcd5 source gates passed, gate=Clean commit e134dcd5103446f97e341059b54d85883e4c52fd built with make build, CLI version identifies e134dcd51034 on v1/v112-wp1101-integration. Exact make test PASS: 2319 tests, 2314 pass, 0 fail, 5 skipped, 2,805,889 ms; includes terminal process-scope fixtures; security lifecycle gates all passed; log SHA-256 716a39d0fe766a3ee3e9defcefa010edb1b02c3c7a64faa570096d8b8b125963. Worktree clean., next=Update qualification record with exact clean-commit evidence, review/commit that record, build RC2 package with pinned container images, verify reproducibility and installed behavior., friction=No exact source-gate friction. Artifact, installation, exact CI/independent acceptance and owner publication are pending.), updated about 4 hours ago\\n  - [doing] RC2 exact-commit evidence record (phase=qualification record update peer review pending, gate=Clean exact source commit e134dcd5103446f97e341059b54d85883e4c52fd: make build PASS, CLI reports correct 1.1.2-rc.2 identity; full make test PASS 2314/0/5 incl terminal scope fixtures and security gates, log SHA-256 716a39d0fe766a3ee3e9defcefa010edb1b02c3c7a64faa570096d8b8b125963. Qualification record updated to this exact evidence; doc-only security gates PASS. Independent reviewer asked to approve the exact-evidence wording., next=On reviewer approval commit the doc evidence update, then build two identical RC2 archives with pinned Rust/Node images and run exact-artifact install/CLI qualification., friction=No gate friction. Artifact and installed-candidate work remains.), updated about 4 hours ago\\n  - [doing] RC2 exact-source package qualification (phase=reproducibility build 2/2, gate=Source and reproducible package generation completed; installer/hash checks PASS but installed-candidate acceptance failed before provider execution. Cause found: exact package helper inherited group-write mode 664 from shared group checkout; trusted evaluator correctly fails closed., next=Compare second output byte-for-byte; rerun installed package acceptance and release installer from canonical-mode artifact., friction=Local shared worktree permissions caused an artifact-only qualification failure; no source commit changes intended., artifact=/tmp/v112-rc2-artifact-a/nexus-linux-x86_64-v1.1.2-rc.2.tar.gz, heartbeat=2026-11-03T19:39:00Z, installed=Archive installed through its production installer from a local HTTP feed under isolated HOME/prefix. SHA verification passed; extracted 160-ish file manifest passed. Installed launcher 1.1.2-rc.2 (e134dcd51034), TUI 1.1.2-rc.2; eval --help works. Provenance records archive fd99bd3f... and source e134dcd5. Attestation intentionally disabled because candidate is unpublished., reproducibleBuildA=Pinned Rust 1.95 and Node 24 digest image build produced archive SHA-256 3e39bd36f31ddd706283febe88b4ecf55cc73c08607c568ca37acd9e9a57fa8b; scanner helper mode 0644 and direct inventory preflight PASS., reproducibleBuildB=Second independent pinned build running in isolated HOME; archive output /tmp/v112-rc2-artifact-d.), updated about 4 hours ago\\n  - [done] RC2 exact-source artifact and qualification (phase=local RC2 artifact gates complete, gate=Source make build and make test PASS 2314/0/5. Two pinned canonical-mode archive builds byte-identical: SHA-256 3e39bd36f31ddd706283febe88b4ecf55cc73c08607c568ca37acd9e9a57fa8b. Installer PASS. eval/package_runtime.test.mjs 5/5 PASS (log 2d1f6edbb7ddb12883564e7dc71d4e42c1dfac7548495d00063e7f0100303f76). Security lifecycle gates PASS (ba472bb002aa50d0be9809bae62f63e9574eaf12440a275fb259e90a50108655)., evidence=docs/evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json SHA-256 37c7fcee8d1058d04a90f672b5949fbaee7710bc22677612036da140dc4cc176. Qualification record updated; /root/review_delta independent review pending., next=Coordinate with the RC15 GATEWAY holder; when cleared, run G1.1-4 on supported endpoints and then move to final stable version qualification., friction=G1.1-4 supported-provider 99.5% JSON metric remains pending because GATEWAY is held by the separate RC15 stream. External CI/CodeQL and release publication remain outside local candidate qualification., heartbeat=2026-11-03T20:10:00Z, claim=RC2 source, package, SUITE, doc and evidence claims released; only unrelated GATEWAY remains held by RC15 stream., retrieval=XERJ hit nexus-cli index.ts:1020 for eval endpoint option; helper mode issue traced to local Git mode 100644 vs worktree 0664; no implementation source changed., candidateSource=e134dcd5103446f97e341059b54d85883e4c52fd, qualificationCommit=3eea888abbf20b4b63c75c2b554debd67038f5a1, review=/root/review_delta APPROVED after final scope clarification, remaining=Release not complete: G1.1-4 supported local-provider JSON metric >=99.5% is pending while GATEWAY claim is held by the RC15 E5 stream. External CI/CodeQL, stable 1.1.2 build and publication remain open. Candidate is local/unpublished; owner publish boundary retained., work_product=[{\\\"title\\\":\\\"v1.1.2 RC2 Linux archive (unpublished candidate)\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/tmp/v112-rc2-artifact-c/nexus-linux-x86_64-v1.1.2-rc.2.tar.gz\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"v1.1.2 qualification record\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1101-integration/docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\\\"}]), updated about 4 hours ago\\n  - [doing] WP-1107 provider grammar integration (phase=Resume coordination after interrupted qualification run, finding=The approved plan's llama request-field assumption is incompatible with current upstream behavior. Do not write code or start RED until we determine whether provider-native tool schema compilation satisfies WP requirement or spec needs another plan revision., scope=User explicitly directs WP-1107 be included with v1.1.2 undergoing release; this supersedes the prior 20:42 deferral., claim=WP-1107 files held in isolated v1/v112-wp1101-integration worktree; preserve claims and confirm current claim registry., next=Check all running suites and claim records, then run one clean full exact-source gate in qualification worktree when SUITE is clear; preserve review approval and do not commit until gate fully green., friction=GATEWAY held by RC15 E5 blocks live provider matrix. Previous full-suite attempt interrupted and did not produce valid final tally., heartbeat=2026-11-03T22:19Z, plan=Added named positive handshake tests for llama.cpp, vLLM, and Ollama, plus missing/malformed/mismatched handshake suppression tests and generic catalog no-grammar regression per reviewer. Awaiting final plan verdict. No source implementation/tests written., retrieval=XERJ prefix wp1107-llama at 6cb3e672e8d1: tools/server/server-common.cpp:1380-1450 rejects explicit grammar whenever non-none tools are supplied; server already passes tool JSON Schemas through common_chat_templates_inputs. Investigating common/chat-auto-parser-generator.cpp and provider docs for supported simultaneous tools+constraint contracts., gate=Focused CLI 38/38 PASS; eval matrix tests 10/10 PASS; npm run build PASS; process_lifecycle 3/3 PASS. Full make test attempt in /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1107-qualification was interrupted; log /tmp/wp1107-full-gate-final3.log is incomplete and invalid as gate evidence. Orphan child PID 2250296 received SIGINT and exited.), updated about 1 hour ago\"}]}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":2,\"result\":{\"chunk_id\":\"a07afe\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.001722245,\"session_id\":28716,\"original_token_count\":0,\"output\":\"\"}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1a331-c45a-70a3-a6bd-1ee2b1ee1a25","create_time":1793748518.1843905}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
