el-bounded and every process is reaped (22047.382014ms)\n✔ resource supervisor preserves SIGTERM grace for descendants after the main payload exits (2484.65841ms)\n✔ candidate sandbox and resource supervisor compose around a staged repository (3739.775976ms)\n✔ repository workspaces carry no history beyond the pinned baseline commit (1438.87404ms)\n✔ task paths reject traversal, symlink escapes, and unstable task trees (4.938969ms)\n✔ task-tree digests frame paths, entry types, executable mode, and content lengths (23.295052ms)\n✔ task setup and validators run with cleared env, no network, confined filesystem, bounded output and timeout (7106.638273ms)\n✔ candidate namespace cannot read host files or bypass pinned compilers with absolute paths (931.371251ms)\n✔ qualification corpus binding rejects missing, mismatched, and post-seal task content (5.9224ms)\n✔ run.mjs refuses to start on an invalid task (253.777092ms)\n✔ the model proxy injects each scheduled fault into the chat request it names, and records it (51.465608ms)\n✔ executable probes refuse bind sources that overlap protected corpus material (8.442033ms)\n✔ T3 task schema requires steering with checkable constraints, a fact sheet, a long budget and Nexus only (20.677184ms)\n✔ the T3 driver submits the objective, steers after the scripted tool calls, snapshots, probes, then shuts down (3405.745862ms)\n✔ the noninteractive T3 driver cancels a checkpoint choice request and does not hang (1.851239ms)\n✔ the probe answer is the last balanced JSON object (0.875327ms)\n✔ compactions count only ids a session or task record commits that have originals in its own archive (6.409504ms)\n✔ T3 evaluator rejects candidate symlinks in workspace facts and steering snapshots (6.781932ms)\n✔ T3 compaction counting rejects symlinks in HOME, .nexus categories, records and archives (5.711098ms)\n✔ T3 scoring judges the snapshot: steering honoured only when applied, violable and kept; false absence counted (2.716793ms)\n✔ a T3 r