{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:19:46.417Z","ordinal":87238,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a1a331-c45a-70a3-a6bd-1ee2b1ee1a25","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016aea7a20a5a881a3b2d990db947f2890","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I reproduced the failure in isolation: 4/5 `task_class` tests pass, with the same stale gateway classification. The likely fix is to refresh only the cached server kind when `discoverAdvertisement()` is explicitly called, while keeping the expensive context and `/api/show` caches intact. That preserves the cache behavior WP-1107 needs while making explicit rediscovery authoritative. A peer is reviewing this diagnosis read-only."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793751584688,"completed_at_ms":1793751586417}}
