 connects provider-specific strict tool schemas to llama.cpp, vLLM, and Ollama request paths after positive identity checks, and adds a runner that measures the exact installed candidate. The exact source diff based on `e134dcd5` passed `make test` (2,342 of 2,347 tests, 0 failures, 5 skips), terminal process-scope fixtures, all security lifecycle gates, and `make build`; its full-gate log SHA-256 is `94046204bcb02186758c7998a1c1a05ccd172ef71d52d0519d29a5210c81cc0b`. Runner unit tests use a synthetic installed-runtime fixture and are not live provider measurements. The change remains uncommitted and has not been packaged or installed; no provider inference was run because the shared `GATEWAY` claim remains held by the RC15 E5 stream.\n+\n ## Separate specialist roadmap status (informational)\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1101-integration/docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1793757943576,"completed_at_ms":1793757943578}}
