{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:06:04.884Z","ordinal":89194,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0fd4138577b17921016aea93016a2c81a3afff3e3511932b14","status":"completed","call_id":"call_0831660e2c9a4c048b13fd0bb397be9e","name":"exec","input":"const patch=\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1101-integration/docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\\n@@\\n-| WP-1107 — GBNF tool grammar | Generate tool-schema grammars and integrate supported provider paths. | Commit `1518780d` adds a bounded schema compiler and four generator tests, but the generator has no callsite in client/provider request construction on `e134dcd5`. No GBNF, `guided_json`, or Ollama schema field is sent. The user-approved full v1.1.0 scope supersedes the older deferral in `ROADMAP-REVIEW.md` §2.5. | **INCOMPLETE — provider integration required** | Existing `cli/test/tool_grammar.test.ts` checks generation only (4/4). Provider request tests and G1.1-4 endpoint measurements are still required. |\\n+| WP-1107 — GBNF tool grammar | Generate tool-schema grammars and integrate supported provider paths. | Commit `1518780d` adds the bounded schema compiler. The current working-tree change connects provider-specific strict tool schemas to llama.cpp, vLLM, and Ollama request paths after positive identity checks. The user-approved full v1.1.2 scope supersedes the older deferral in `ROADMAP-REVIEW.md` §2.5. | **SOURCE INTEGRATION QUALIFIED; LIVE PROVIDER MATRIX PENDING** | Provider identity/request regressions and the exact-source suite pass. G1.1-4's supported-endpoint 99.5% metric is unmeasured; the recorded RC2 archive predates this change and is not eligible for release. |\\n@@\\n-| G1.1-4 — Constrained decoding | At least 99.5% valid tool-call JSON across supported provider endpoints. | The generator is not connected to any client/provider request path on `e134dcd5`; its unit tests do not demonstrate constrained decoding. The shared `GATEWAY` claim remains held by another release stream, so no endpoint metric has been collected. | **IMPLEMENTATION INCOMPLETE; PROVIDER MATRIX PENDING** |\\n+| G1.1-4 — Constrained decoding | At least 99.5% valid tool-call JSON across supported provider endpoints. | Provider-specific strict tool-schema requests are connected and locally tested. The shared `GATEWAY` claim remains held by the RC15 E5 stream, so no endpoint metric has been collected. | **SOURCE INTEGRATION PASSED; PROVIDER MATRIX PENDING** |\\n@@\\n-- [ ] WP-1107 provider-specific request integration and request-shape tests pass on the final source candidate.\\n+- [x] WP-1107 provider-specific request integration and request-shape tests pass on the local source diff based on `e134dcd5`; committed-candidate and installed-artifact qualification remain pending.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1a331-c45a-70a3-a6bd-1ee2b1ee1a25","create_time":1793757953.4184659}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:06:04.916Z","ordinal":89195,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a1a331-c45a-70a3-a6bd-1ee2b1ee1a25","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-08cfd088-9b19-4a88-a13b-2be98f9fd198","changes":{"/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1101-integration/docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -33,3 +33,3 @@\n | WP-1106 — Single-step loop mode | `--step` and `/step` pause deterministically after one agent turn for operator confirmation. | Integrated in commits `1cc28f94` and `faca6e6c`. CLI flag `--step`, REPL `/step`, and TUI `/step` catalogue entry with session command handler. | **PASSED** | Validated in `cli/test/step_loop.test.ts` (8/8 passed) and `cli/test/slash_router.test.ts` (34/34 passed). |\n-| WP-1107 — GBNF tool grammar | Generate tool-schema grammars and integrate supported provider paths. | Commit `1518780d` adds a bounded schema compiler and four generator tests, but the generator has no callsite in client/provider request construction on `e134dcd5`. No GBNF, `guided_json`, or Ollama schema field is sent. The user-approved full v1.1.0 scope supersedes the older deferral in `ROADMAP-REVIEW.md` §2.5. | **INCOMPLETE — provider integration required** | Existing `cli/test/tool_grammar.test.ts` checks generation only (4/4). Provider request tests and G1.1-4 endpoint measurements are still required. |\n+| WP-1107 — GBNF tool grammar | Generate tool-schema grammars and integrate supported provider paths. | Commit `1518780d` adds the bounded schema compiler. The current working-tree change connects provider-specific strict tool schemas to llama.cpp, vLLM, and Ollama request paths after positive identity checks. The user-approved full v1.1.2 scope supersedes the older deferral in `ROADMAP-REVIEW.md` §2.5. | **SOURCE INTEGRATION QUALIFIED; LIVE PROVIDER MATRIX PENDING** | Provider identity/request regressions and the exact-source suite pass. G1.1-4's supported-endpoint 99.5% metric is unmeasured; the recorded RC2 archive predates this change and is not eligible for release. |\n | WP-1108 — Dependency modernization | Triage and integrate 27 Dependabot updates while meeting zero-deprecation and compatibility requirements. | Integrated in commit `5f1f0677`. All 27 Dependabot PRs triaged and merged. `cargo deny check` clean. Zero deprecated npm packages. | **PASSED** | Merged CycloneDX SBOM generated (141 total components: 119 Cargo + 20 npm). glibc <= 2.35 verified on Rust binaries. |\n@@ -43,3 +43,3 @@\n | G1.1-3 — CLI parity | Packaged `nexus eval` works without developer dependencies on the exact release candidate. | Exact archive passed all five package-runtime acceptance tests, including evaluation outside checkout and launching a candidate without mounting evaluator code. | **PACKAGE PASS** |\n-| G1.1-4 — Constrained decoding | At least 99.5% valid tool-call JSON across supported provider endpoints. | The generator is not connected to any client/provider request path on `e134dcd5`; its unit tests do not demonstrate constrained decoding. The shared `GATEWAY` claim remains held by another release stream, so no endpoint metric has been collected. | **IMPLEMENTATION INCOMPLETE; PROVIDER MATRIX PENDING** |\n+| G1.1-4 — Constrained decoding | At least 99.5% valid tool-call JSON across supported provider endpoints. | Provider-specific strict tool-schema requests are connected and locally tested. The shared `GATEWAY` claim remains held by the RC15 E5 stream, so no endpoint metric has been collected. | **SOURCE INTEGRATION PASSED; PROVIDER MATRIX PENDING** |\n | G1.1-5 — Zero technical debt | Zero deprecated/unmaintained packages, zero CodeQL alerts and compiler warnings, plus required suite/PTY, cargo-deny, npm scans, reproducibility, and CLI option compatibility without breaking unprivileged sandbox invariants. | Exact source commit passed full suite, TypeScript build, npm/cargo lifecycle scans, and terminal process-scope fixtures. The exact archive is reproducible, has a validated 141-component CycloneDX SBOM and checksums, installs through `install.sh`, and passes package runtime/CLI acceptance. External CodeQL/CI and release-level PTY evidence are not present in this record. | **SOURCE AND LOCAL ARTIFACT GATES PASS; EXTERNAL CI / PTY PENDING** |\n@@ -87,3 +87,3 @@\n - [x] WP-1101–WP-1106 and WP-1108 source acceptance and test suites are bound to exact commit `e134dcd5103446f97e341059b54d85883e4c52fd`; WP-1103/WP-1104 package acceptance is bound to archive `3e39bd36…`.\n-- [ ] WP-1107 provider-specific request integration and request-shape tests pass on the final source candidate.\n+- [x] WP-1107 provider-specific request integration and request-shape tests pass on the local source diff based on `e134dcd5`; committed-candidate and installed-artifact qualification remain pending.\n - [ ] Applicable v1.1.0 release gates G1.1-1 through G1.1-5 are qualified on the final candidate.\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1101-integration/docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1793757964915,"completed_at_ms":1793757964916}}
